        <item>
            <title>0.17.2</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 16:15:04 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>0.17.2</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.17.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in 0.17.2</h2>
<ul>
<li>**One Trigger setting** — Settings › Trigger is now a ladder of numbered levels: Click, Swipe past the pill, Swipe toward the pill (expert). It replaces the two separate switches</li>
<li>**Setup has a third lesson** — tap ⌘, then use the arrow keys to pick a pill</li>
<li>**Smoother Arrange** — entering and leaving Arrange, picking a pill up and the folder bloom no longer stutter</li>
<li>**Dials: fine steps are ⌥⇧, like macOS** — hold Option+Shift (either Option) while turning a dial for small steps, the keys macOS uses on its volume and brightness keys. Option alone no longer makes steps finer</li>
<li>**Hyper + a modifier + the arrow keys use the menu&#x27;s own arrows** — diagonals work, the pill fires when you let go, and you see its confirmation</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
